            ^"Effect Design" STRING "(Base 5, +1 Touch, +2 Sun, +2 Room; +1 frequency, +3 environmental trigger, +3 linked trigger, +26 penetration)"
            ^"Required Lab Total" STRING "Required Lab Total: 1 season (126), 2 seasons (95), 3 seasons (84), 4 seasons (79)"
            ^"Printed Effect Line" STRING "ReMe 63 Pen: 52, Constant Effect R: Touch, D: Sun, T: Room"
            ^"Source" STRING "Hermetic Projects"
